  "_about": "Game type (.json) and playlist rules/options. Sources: the Project Reclaimer docs (projectreclaimer.dev: game modes, host/playlist reference, Megalo trait values) and the five bundled modes in Documents/My Games/Project Reclaimer/Game Modes. Option values are the numbers the client writes; 'verified: false' marks labels inferred rather than documented. Run 'dedicated check' (Export tab) to confirm. Starting weapons: the exact list the dedicated server prints for an unknown choice (Project Reclaimer 0.9.4), numbered from -3 in that order; matches Magnum 7, Rocket launcher 10, Shotgun 11, Spartan laser 16 and No weapon 17 seen in real variants.",
